  "prefLabel": "Puc 2004.01 Department Petitions to the Commission",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2004.01 Department Petitions to the Commission. Upon receipt of a petition filed by the department alleging a sanctionable event pursuant to En 2005.01, the commission shall begin adjudicative proceedings in accordance with RSA 541-A:31 and Puc 200.\n\nSource. #7758, eff 9-4-02; ss by #9774-A, eff 8-26-10; ss by #12372, eff 11-1-17; ss by #14576, eff 5-13-26, EXPIRES: 5-13-36 (formerly Puc 2005.01)",
